title The history no run ever wrote
prompt Autonomous loop -- Standfast first, then the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, council rota row 4
think Standfast opened the lap and the line was clear. Every living REDS row closed, %127 and its closure both standing, so constructive work was free to begin.
think The running thread named the crux plainly. Last lap's recommend put seat_the_history at the head of the Caravan carry queue -- 17 rungs by 72 lines, 1152 carried -- and the meter agreed when run rather than remembered.
think Council rota row 4, Earth and Mercury, the concrete: the one-clock naming law, Two Rooms, and the marked value. Two Rooms shaped the lap directly -- a claim earns the checkable room only when a witness binds it, so nothing here is claimed ahead of the seventeen rung witnesses and the choir.
think Measured the family before touching it. Hashing every seat_the_history body across the 110 modules found 17 identical at 72 lines and five near-neighbors at 35, 51, 54, 57, and 69 -- so the fold is exactly seventeen, and the five stay where they are because they are genuinely different bodies rather than drifted copies.
think Checked the contract before writing it. Twenty-three symbols the body reaches for, checked across all seventeen: every one present, and exactly one -- standing_settlement -- private in all seventeen alike. Uniform, so widening it split no family, and a const is a line the carry meter does not read.
think Lifted the body into caravan/ladder_checks.rye with the rung handed in comptime, every reach prefixed rung., and left the seventeen holding a three-line call under the doc comment they already carried.
obs The fall is exactly the family's own carry less its call. Carry 86,774 to 85,670, a fall of 1,104, which is 16 copies at 72 lines returned less 16 copies at 3 lines paid. Delegates rise 2,444 to 2,461, exactly seventeen. The two numbers move apart, which is how a reader tells a fold from a cost moved somewhere cheaper to count.
obs A guard I had not met caught my own prose within the lap. tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_copy_scan.sh refuses any ladder meter that recites a number in prose with no assert holding it, and my two new narration lines recited 1,104 and 86,774. The numbers now live only in the asserts and the scan's own printed output. This is REDS %110's family exactly -- a number a hand republishes is a number that will one day be republished wrong -- and it is a loom rather than a lantern, so it fired rather than taught.
obs The rota row was load-bearing rather than decorative. Two Rooms says a behavioral claim earns the checkable room only when a witness binds it. So the ceiling came down to 85,676 and the queue asserts moved to seat_the_record and read_the_finding in the same act as the lift -- the meter's claims about the ladder and the ladder itself moving in one commit, which is the docs-stay-synced rule read at the level of a witness.
obs No cairn is owed. Nothing left the tree that was not byte-identical to something that stayed; a lift is the shallowest of the three depths of removal, and it cuts nothing.
