recommend keep-going the queue's new head is seat_the_record at 37 rungs by 30 lines, then read_the_finding at 20 by 55, then may_pass at 51 by 19 -- seat_the_record is the crux, the widest of the three and the same harness pattern proven now at seventeen, forty-three, and seventy-nine. Beside it the machine half of the address space stays owed and named: page-table entry bytes, an ASID from seL4_ASIDPoolBits, and the retype itself. The libsel4 generator gate (jinja2, ply) is still Keaton's word, still blocking rungs 3 and 4 of the Microkernel Target arc.
